corollaries/ChowlaRH.lean, corollaries/ChowlaRH/
  From https://github.com/anaxia-research/chawla-rh, by Deep Bhattacharjee:
  SquareKernel.lean, MertensTransfer.lean, Chowla.lean and SignPatterns.lean,
  unchanged apart from building on Lean v4.34.1 and Mathlib v4.34.1;
  ChowlaRH.lean imports only these four files.

corollaries/LiouvilleEnergyRH/Mertens/
  From https://github.com/anaxia-research/averaged-chowla-grh, by Deep
  Bhattacharjee. ZetaBound.lean is unchanged; it follows the Abel-integral
  argument of Vinogradov/MRT.lean (adapted from OpenAI's library).
  Contour.lean (a generic form of Vinogradov/CharacterSums.lean) and Main.lean
  are generalized here from the zero-free half-plane re s > 1/2 to
  re s > σa.

corollaries/LiouvilleEnergyRH/PrimeCount/
  From https://github.com/anaxia-research/prime-counting-rh, by Deep
  Bhattacharjee, generalized here from re s > 1/2 to re s > σa. ContourB.lean
  is the argument of Mertens/Contour.lean for coefficients bounded by B, with
  the unsmoothing step of Vinogradov/PV/PrimeSum.lean.

corollaries/LiouvilleEnergyRH/Progressions/
  From https://github.com/anaxia-research/primes-in-progressions-grh, by Deep
  Bhattacharjee, generalized here from Hypothesis H to the zero-free
  half-plane re s > σa; least_prime_in_AP_seven_eighths is added.

corollaries/LiouvilleEnergyRH/Lindelof/Strip.lean
  From https://github.com/anaxia-research/lindelof-rh, by Deep Bhattacharjee,
  generalized here from re s > 1/2, 1/2 + 8e ≤ σ ≤ 3/4 to re s > σa,
  σa + 8e ≤ σ ≤ b < 1.

corollaries/LiouvilleEnergyRH/Unconditional.lean
  The proofs of shifted_sum_bound and two_point_shift_average are those of
  AveragedChowla.lean (anaxia-research/averaged-chowla-grh and
  anaxia-research/liouville-energy-rh), with the exponent 1/2 + ε replaced by
  7/8 + ε. The zero-free half-plane is OpenAI's theorem (see corollaries/OAI/).

corollaries/LiouvilleEnergyRH/TwoPointChowla.lean
  Applies OpenAI's two-point theorem (see corollaries/OAI/) and
  ChowlaRH/SignPatterns.lean.
